        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From The Square in Oughterard, proceed along Camp Street, keeping The Lake Hotel on your left and The Boat Inn on your right. Bear left over the bridge and note your mileage. Continue along the Glann Road for 5 miles and the property will be found on the left hand side marked by our `FOR SALE` board. Eircode H91 VRF8."
